    {
      "id": "progdesign_lv1",
      "speaker": "ProgDesign",
      "text": "刚学完循环结构？来，我考你一个：实现一个反转字符串的函数，能用几种方法？",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "for 循环原地交换",
          "next": "progdesign_lv1_correct",
          "effects": [{"target": "affinity.ProgDesign", "delta": 3}]
        },
        {
          "text": "用 std::reverse",
          "next": "progdesign_lv1_lazy",
          "effects": [{"target": "affinity.ProgDesign", "delta": 1}]
        },
        {
          "text": "递归实现",
          "next": "progdesign_lv1_creative",
          "effects": [{"target": "affinity.ProgDesign", "delta": 4}]
        }
      ],
      "condition": "affinity.ProgDesign < 30"
    },
    {
      "id": "progdesign_lv1_correct",
      "speaker": "ProgDesign",
      "text": "经典做法。双指针向中间靠拢，O(n) 时间、O(1) 空间，正确。",
      "choices": [{"text": "（继续）", "next": "END", "effects": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": "progdesign_lv1_lazy",
      "speaker": "ProgDesign",
      "text": "标准库当然可以，但作为初学者，你应该理解它背后做了什么。下次试试手写。",
      "choices": [{"text": "好的", "next": "END", "effects": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": "progdesign_lv1_creative",
      "speaker": "ProgDesign",
      "text": "（眼神微亮）……能想到递归说明你的思维有深度。栈空间的代价我们以后再谈。",
      "choices": [{"text": "（被夸了，开心）", "next": "END", "effects": []}]
    },
    {
      "id": "progdesign_lv2",
      "speaker": "ProgDesign",
      "text": "你现在的水平已经超过班里大多数人了。下次大作业我们组队？",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "好啊！",
          "next": "progdesign_lv2_yes",
          "effects": [{"target": "affinity.ProgDesign", "delta": 5}]
        },
        {
          "text": "我想自己挑战",
          "next": "progdesign_lv2_solo",
          "effects": [{"target": "affinity.ProgDesign", "delta": 2}]
        }
      ],
      "condition": "affinity.ProgDesign >= 60"
